<view class="page safety-page">
  <view class="safety-hero">
    <view class="safety-eyebrow tt-kicker">安全与支持</view>
    <view class="safety-title">先照顾自己的感受与安全</view>
    <view class="safety-copy">这里说明平台现在能做什么、不能做什么，以及需要帮助时可以从哪里开始。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card urgent-card">
    <view class="section-title">感到不适或不安全时</view>
    <view class="section-copy">请先停止回复、离开当前会话，不要继续私下转账、交换联系方式或安排线下见面。出现即时危险时，请联系当地紧急服务或身边可信的人。</view>
    <view class="section-note">平台不提供报警、紧急救援、医疗或危机干预服务。</view>
    <button class="leave-button" bindtap="leaveCurrentInteraction">先离开当前互动</button>
    <view class="action-note">离开不会取消已有订单，也不会代为提交举报。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">怎么看“已认证”</view>
    <view class="section-copy">资料页的“已认证”表示该资料当前通过平台的展示资格检查并处于可公开查看状态。它不等同于医疗、心理治疗、紧急干预资质，也不保证某次服务体验或时段一定可用。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">沟通与服务边界</view>
    <view class="section-copy">服务、沟通和支付应留在平台内完成。请不要交换私人联系方式、私下转账或约线下见面；线上陪伴不替代医疗、心理治疗或紧急帮助。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card action-card">
    <view class="section-title">举报与处理进度</view>
    <view class="section-copy">你可以在这里新建安全举报；若事件与具体聊天有关，也可在聊天中举报整个会话或长按一条消息举报该内容。</view>
    <view class="section-note">提交后会生成案件编号，并可查看受理、审核、处置结果及补充说明。平台不会把“已提交”冒充“已处理”。</view>
    <button class="primary-action" bindtap="openSafetyReport">新建安全举报</button>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="openMessages">从具体消息举报</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card appeal-card">
    <view class="section-title">我的内容申诉</view>
    <view class="section-copy">被拦截的内容或聊天限言可以在通知中发起一次申诉。提交后由非原处置审核员独立复核，平台会展示计划处理时间和最终结果。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{focusCaseId || focusAppealId || focusRestrictionId}}" class="section-note">
      正在显示这条通知对应的处置或申诉。
      <button class="text-button" bindtap="clearNotificationFocus">查看全部记录</button>
    </view>
    <view class="appeal-subtitle">可以申请复核</view>
    <view wx:if="{{appealableCasesLoading}}" class="appeal-state">正在核对可申诉处置…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{appealableCasesError}}" class="appeal-error" role="alert">
      <view>{{appealableCasesError}}</view>
      <button class="retry-button" bindtap="retryAppealableCases">重新核对</button>
    </view>
    <block wx:elif="{{appealableCases.length}}">
      <view wx:for="{{appealableCases}}" wx:key="caseId" class="appeal-item eligible-item">
        <view class="appeal-head">
          <view class="appeal-status status-pending">可申诉</view>
          <view class="appeal-id">案件 {{item.caseId}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="appeal-reason">{{item.summary}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.contentPreview}}" class="appeal-preview">{{item.contentPreview}}</view>
        <view class="appeal-deadline">请在 {{item.appealDeadlineText}} 前提交</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.restrictionEndsAtText}}" class="appeal-meta">限制预计结束：{{item.restrictionEndsAtText}}</view>
        <view class="appeal-meta">处置时间 {{item.createdAtText}} · 规则版本 {{item.policyVersion}}</view>
        <button class="appeal-submit" data-case-id="{{item.caseId}}" loading="{{submittingCaseId === item.caseId}}" disabled="{{submittingCaseId !== ''}}" bindtap="appealCase">申请独立复核</button>
      </view>
    </block>
    <view wx:elif="{{appealableCasesLoaded}}" class="appeal-state">目前没有处于提交期限内的可申诉处置。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{appealableCasesTotalPages > 1}}" class="rule-actions">
      <button class="text-button" disabled="{{appealableCasesPage <= 1}}" bindtap="previousAppealableCasesPage">上一页</button>
      <text>共 {{appealableCasesTotal}} 条 · {{appealableCasesPage}} / {{appealableCasesTotalPages}} 页</text>
      <button class="text-button" disabled="{{appealableCasesPage >= appealableCasesTotalPages}}" bindtap="nextAppealableCasesPage">下一页</button>
    </view>
    <view class="appeal-subtitle history-subtitle">处理记录</view>
    <view wx:if="{{appealsLoading}}" class="appeal-state">正在同步申诉状态…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{appealsError}}" class="appeal-error" role="alert">
      <view>{{appealsError}}</view>
      <button class="retry-button" bindtap="retryAppeals">重新加载</button>
    </view>
    <block wx:elif="{{appeals.length}}">
      <view wx:for="{{appeals}}" wx:key="id" class="appeal-item {{item.overdue ? 'appeal-overdue' : ''}}">
        <view class="appeal-head">
          <view class="appeal-status status-{{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</view>
          <view class="appeal-id">案件 {{item.caseId}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="appeal-reason">{{item.reason}}</view>
        <view class="appeal-deadline">{{item.reviewStateText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.reviewedAtText}}" class="appeal-meta">{{item.reviewedAtText}}</view>
        <view class="appeal-meta">提交于 {{item.createdAtText}} · 规则版本 {{item.policyVersion}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
    <view wx:elif="{{appealsLoaded}}" class="appeal-state">目前没有内容申诉记录。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{appealsTotalPages > 1}}" class="rule-actions">
      <button class="text-button" disabled="{{appealsPage <= 1}}" bindtap="previousAppealsPage">上一页</button>
      <text>共 {{appealsTotal}} 条 · {{appealsPage}} / {{appealsTotalPages}} 页</text>
      <button class="text-button" disabled="{{appealsPage >= appealsTotalPages}}" bindtap="nextAppealsPage">下一页</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card action-card">
    <view class="section-title">客服案件、订单与售后</view>
    <view class="section-copy">退款、支付、履约、隐私与一般问题可创建客服案件。若问题对应某一订单，建议先从订单详情进入售后，以便自动关联订单。</view>
    <view class="section-note">客服案件与安全举报分开记录；列表加载不完整时会明确提示，不会用空列表冒充没有案件。</view>
    <button class="primary-action" bindtap="openSupportCenter">查看全部案件</button>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="openOrders">从订单进入售后</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card rules-card">
    <view class="section-title">规则与隐私</view>
    <view class="section-copy">你可以随时查看平台规则和隐私政策，了解平台内沟通、内容审核及信息处理的边界。</view>
    <view class="rule-actions">
      <button class="text-button" bindtap="openTerms">查看用户协议</button>
      <button class="text-button" bindtap="openPrivacy">查看隐私政策</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="safety-footer">只有在你确认提交举报或客服表单后，平台才会创建案件；单纯浏览本页或离开当前互动不会写入安全记录。</view>
</view>
